              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-95184?s=debian&n=gnutls28&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=13&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "Improper certificate validation in gnutls v3.8.13 causes the application to reject legitimate certificates for valid users, leading to a Denial of Service (DoS).\n\n---\n- gnutls28 <unfixed>\nTODO: check if https://gist.github.com/lkloliver/0c8b47fa75a0958fa88587665b82ae15 reported upstream, valid?\n",
