            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-86140",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-86140"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-86140?s=debian&n=libxml2&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=13&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "In libxml2 before 2.15.4, xmlSnprintfElements in valid.c has a strcat stack-based buffer overflow.\n\n---\n- libxml2 2.15.4+dfsg-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1146744)\n[bookworm] - libxml2 <postponed> (Minor issue)\nFixed by: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libxml2/-/commit/d1686f91dbda141a752200419d35639fd6b38340 (v2.15.4)\n",
                "markdown": "> In libxml2 before 2.15.4, xmlSnprintfElements in valid.c has a strcat stack-based buffer overflow.\n\n---\n- libxml2 2.15.4+dfsg-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1146744)\n[bookworm] - libxml2 <postponed> (Minor issue)\nFixed by: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libxml2/-/commit/d1686f91dbda141a752200419d35639fd6b38340 (v2.15.4)\n\n|                                                                                                                                 |\n|Package         pkg:deb/debian/libxml2@2.12.7%2Bdfsg%2Breally2.9.14-2.1%2Bdeb13u3?os_distro=trixie&os_name=debian&os_version=13  |\n|Affected range  >0                                                                                                               |\n|Fixed version   not fixed                                                                                                        |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
